      "q": "How much does General Services Administration spend on contracts?",
      "a": "GSA has $19.4B in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. That total comes from 934,899 awards at an average award size of $20.8K. Obligations are down 18.4% year over year, and the FY2026 number is a partial, fiscal year to date total compared with full-year totals like $23.8B in FY25 and $26.5B in FY24."
